M/s Embention. The procurement is under progress.\r\n\r\nc.   Order is placed for procurement of JetCat P-220 (Germany based 220N) turbo jet engine for HSTD-SDM. The procurement is under progress. \r\n\r\nd.   Sample material for airframe manufacturing is procured. Plan for sample preparation and subsequent destructive testing (DT) & Non Destructive Testing (NDT) is also completed. The testing will be carried out using NRDI NDT center PNEC and PCSIR equipment. Consequently, the airframe material will be finalized based on the test results. \r\n\r\n3.   Way Forward. \r\n\r\na.   Testing of sample materials for airframe components will be carried out. The outcome of these activities will lead towards the 2nd iteration of critical design activities and design review / revision prior to design finalization activities. \r\n\r\nb.   HSTD-SDM will be manufactured and different sensors will be installed for subsequent ground / aerial testing and evaluation of design concept. \r\n\r\nc.   Modifications / improvements in the critical design of HSTD will be undertaken in lines with the outcomes of design, development and field testing of HSTD- SDM.\r\n\r\nd.   Ground testing of turbo-jet engine will be performed. An avionics test bench will be designed for the setup and integration of both onboard and ground avionics.	DSensors	Finalized	2021-01-06 12:54:49	25	Dec 20	-20-25-	\N	f	\N
