350005	350	2021-03-01 16:14:06	1.   Design / Development Activities.\r\n\r\na.   Design activities of Scaled Down Model HSTD, named as Marlin-01, are completed. Manufacturing plans are exported for subsequent manufacturing of UAV for ground / aerial testing.\r\nb.   Pattern manufacturing of airframe components is completed. Pattern finishing activities and subsequent mold fabrication is also started on the completed patterns are initiated on completed patterns.\r\n\r\nc.   Concrete flooring is being constructed at Serial Production Facility (SPF) for composite layup and related manufacturing activities of Marlin-01.\r\n\r\nd.   Design of full scaled HSTD is being revised based on the learnings from design/ manufacturing activities of Marlin-01. In this regards, imperative consideration is given to design modularity and ease of manufacturing / assembly of airframe components and onboard systems. A modular design will also furnish convenience of repair and maintenance processes along with ease of storage and transportation.\r\n\r\ne.   Jet Engine Test Bench. Detailed design of test bench for P-1000 and P-220 turbo jet engines is completed. Drafting of manufacturing drawings is under progress for subsequent manufacturing. Electronics has also been shortlisted and presently being procured.\r\na.   UAV Launcher. Design of full scaled UAV launcher is completed. Local industry is engaged for the manufacturing of pneumatic actuator in lines with the INTELL design.\r\n\r\nf.   Design and analysis activities of SDM UAV Launcher is also completed.  SDM launcher will also serve as test bench for pneumatic circuit of full scale UAV launcher. Drafting of manufacturing drawings and subsequent manufacturing / assembly process is under progress.\r\n\r\ng.   Leveled concrete flooring is being constructed at SPF for assembly and testing of SDM launcher / pneumatic circuit test bench. \r\n\r\nh.   Material Testing. Destructive Testing (DT) of composite material samples is being carried out using PNEC and PCSIR equipment. The test results will furnish material strength data for consolidation of design and improvement of manufacturing quality.\r\n\r\n2.   Hardware Procurement Status.\r\n\r\na.   Order is placed for procurement of JetCat P-1000 (Germany based 1100N) turbo jet engine. The procurement is under progress.\r\n\r\nb.   Order is placed for procurement of Veronte Flight controller of M/s Embention. The procurement is under progress.\r\n\r\nc.   Order is placed for procurement of JetCat P-220 (Germany based 220N) turbo jet engine for HSTD-01. The procurement is under progress with an EDD of mid-March.\r\n\r\nd.   Material for manufacturing of Marlin-01 and SDM launcher / pneumatic system test bench are being purchased / procured.\r\n\r\n3.   Way Forward. \r\n\r\na.   Flight data acquisition system with various sensors will be developed and installed on-board Marlin-01 for subsequent ground / aerial testing and evaluation of design concept.\r\n\r\nb.   Modifications / improvements in the design of full scale HSTD system will be undertaken in lines with the outcomes of development and field testing of Marlin-01. \r\n\r\nc.   The design of structure and mechanism will be revised / refined based on experience gained from field testing and evaluation of SDM-UAV launcher.\r\n\r\nd.   Manufacturing of jet engine test bench will be undertaken. The test bench will serve the purpose of ground testing / tuning of various operating parameters prior to integration with airframe.\r\n\r\ne.   Ground testing of turbo-jet engine will be performed. Also, an avionics test bench will be designed for the setup and integration of both; onboard and ground avionics.	DSensors	Finalized	2021-03-04 11:20:05	25	Feb 21	-20-25-	\N	f	\N
