ch Grinder has also been placed.\r\n\r\n6.   Team development. Hiring of additional engineers and students has been initiated to further develop HR strength at INTELL. Final interviews of shortlisted candidates have been carried out and hiring is under process.	DSensors	Edited	2021-04-27 09:26:54	25	Mar 21	-20-25-	\N	f	\N
