350005	445	2021-05-28 13:04:06	1.   Design/ Development Activities.\r\n\r\na.   Design and mold/ pattern manufacturing activities of MARLIN-01 are completed. Manufacturing of airframe skin and machining of structural members are also complete. Assembly of structure and integration onboard systems are under progress.\r\n\r\nb.   Design of MARLIN-02 (full scaled HSTD) is being revised based on the learnings from design / manufacturing activities of MARLIN-01. Detailed design of airframe and integration with launch/ recovery systems are also completed. Integration of avionics, and water-proof fastening of sub system assemblies are under progress.\r\n\r\nc.   Jet Engine Testing. Manufacturing and assembly of test bench for P-1000 and P-220 turbo jet engine is completed. P220 Turbo jet engine (for MARLIN-01) was successfully started and bench trials have been initiated. Further testing for evaluation of performance parameters is under progress.\r\n\r\nd.   P220 Turbo jet engine testing (for MARLIN-01) has been successfully completed on the inhouse designed and developed testbench. Point recommended to be dropped.\r\n\r\ne.   UAV Launcher. Design and analysis activities of MARLIN-01 Launcher / pneumatic circuit testing bench are complete. Manufacture / assemble of rail beams, beam hinges, actuator mounts & pulley block is also completed. Manufacturing of carriage assembly, snatch block, rope assembly and beams seats are under progress.  \r\n\r\nf.   MARLIN-02 launcher. Design of MARLIN-02 launcher is being redesigned based on the learning from design / development of MARLIN-01 Launcher. In this regard, imperative consideration is being given to weight reduction, ease of assembly and transportation. Local industry is engaged for the manufacturing of pneumatic actuator in lines with the INTELL design.\r\n\r\ng.   Construction of separate shaded floors for composite layup and launcher manufacturing at Serial Production Facility (SPF) are completed. Point recommended to be dropped.\r\n\r\nh.   Material Testing. Destructive Testing (DT) of composite material samples is being carried out using PNEC and PCSIR equipment. Tensile tests and first phase of bending tests are completed. Manufacturing process is improved in lines with the test results. Bending tests of improved samples are under progress. \r\nj.   Wind Tunnel Testing. Computer Aided Design (CAD) model, for development of testing model, has been shared as per the requirements of DESTO.  Estimated of quotation & timeline of 190 working days is received from DESTO. DESTO has been requested to reduce the timeline.\r\n\r\n2.   Hardware Procurement Status.\r\n\r\na.   Order is placed for procurement of JetCat P-1000 (Germany based 1100N) turbo jet engine. The procurement is under progress.\r\n\r\nb.   Order is placed for procurement of Veronte Flight controller of M/s Embention. The procurement is under progress.\r\n\r\nc.   Material for manufacturing of MARLIN-01 UAV and Launcher are being purchased / procured as per the requirement of manufacturing under progress.\r\n\r\nd.   Orders are placed for raw material for MARLIN-02 UAV and Launcher. The procurement is under progress.	DSensors	Edited	2021-06-15 14:54:11	25	May 21	-20-25-	\N	f	\N
