350005	248	2020-11-09 14:57:37	1.   Design Activities.\r\n\r\n   a.   Engine mounts and intake ducts are designed for JetCat P-1000 turbo jet engine. The designed mounts and duct are integrated into the airframe.  Servos and control mechanism are integrated in the airframe. Optimized hatches are designed to provide aerodynamics fairing to the control mechanism.\r\n\r\n   b.   Detailed critical design of wing, empennage, control surface, fuselage & fuel tank is undertaken and first iteration of critical design phase is completed.\r\n\r\n   c.   UAV Launcher. CAD modelling of pneumatic circuit components and rail structure in lines with the design calculations is undertaken. Market analysis is conducted to assess the availability of components. Local industry is engaged for the manufacturing of the pneumatic actuator in lines with the INTELL design.\r\n\r\n   d.   A scaled down model of the HSTD is being designed. Activities pertaining to preliminary design and structure design of wings, tail and fuselage are undertaken. The scaled down model will serve as platform for testing of various design concept and manufacturing techniques.\r\n\r\n2.   Hardware Procurement Status.\r\n\r\n   a.   Order is placed for procurement of JetCat P-1000 (Germany based 1100N) turbo jet engine. The procurement is under progress. \r\n\r\n   b.   Veronte Flight controller of M/s Embention has been finalized. Quotations for avionics and related ground equipment have been acquired from M/s Embention, Spain. The procurement case has been raised for approval.\r\n\r\n   c.   Material samples for manufacturing different parts of airframe are being procured. Airframe material will be finalized based on destructive testing (DT) & Non Destructive Testing (NDT). The testing will be carried out using NRDI NDT center PNEC and PCSIR equipment.\r\n\r\n3.   Way Forward. Testing of sample materials for airframe components will be carried out. The outcome of these activities will lead towards the 2nd iteration of critical design activities and design review / revision prior to design finalization activities.	DSensors	Edited	2020-11-11 10:32:10	25	Oct 20	-20-25-	\N	f	\N
