amples have been carried out using PNEC and PCSIR equipment. Tensile tests are completed, bending tests are under progress. Design is being consolidated and manufacturing process is being improved based on the testing data. \r\n\r\nh.   Wind Tunnel Testing. Computer Aided Design (CAD) model, for development of testing model, has been shared as per the requirements of DESTO. The case is under processing at DESTO for timeline / quotation of model development & subsequent testing.\r\n\r\n2.   Hardware Procurement Status.\r\n\r\na.   Order is placed for procurement of JetCat P-1000 (Germany based 1100N) turbo jet engine. The procurement is under progress.\r\n\r\nb.   Order is placed for procurement of Veronte Flight controller of M/s Embention. The procurement is under progress.\r\n\r\nc.   Material for manufacturing of MARLIN-01 UAV and Launcher are being purchased / procured as per the requirement of manufacturing under progress.	DR&D	Finalized	2021-05-05 09:38:30	25	Apr 21	-20-25-	-20-25-	f	\N
