d based on the learning from design / development of MARLIN-01 Launcher. In this regard, imperative consideration is being given to weight reduction, ease of assembly and transportation. Manufacturing of customized high pneumatic actuator through local industry is also completed. \r\n\r\nj.   Material Testing. Destructive Testing (DT) of composite material samples is being carried out using PNEC and PCSIR equipment. Tensile tests and first phase of bending tests are completed. Manufacturing process is improved in lines with the test results. Bending tests of improved samples are under progress. Also, testing of different composite coring materials is being planned.\r\n\r\nk.   Wind Tunnel Testing. Computer Aided Design (CAD) model, for development of testing model, has been shared as per the requirements of DESTO.  Estimated of quotation & timeline of 190 working days is received from DESTO. DESTO has been requested to reduce the timeline.\r\n\r\n2.   Hardware Procurement Status.\r\n\r\na.   JetCat P-1000 (Germany based 1100N) turbo jet engine, EDD Aug 21\r\nb.   Veronte Flight controller of M/s Embention\r\nc.   Raw material for MARLIN-02 UAV and launcher\r\nd.   Material for finishing of MARLIN-01 UAV and launcher (as per manufacturing requirements)	DSensors	Finalized	2021-08-27 14:04:15	25	Jul 21	-20-25-	\N	f	\N
