350005	531	2021-08-31 10:41:05	1.   Design / Development Activities.\r\n\r\na.   MARLIN-01 UAV.  Airframe manufacturing, assembly, avionics / control / data link integration and testing activates are completed.  Ground tests of airframe, propulsion, data link and control system are also completed.\r\n\r\nb.   MARLIN-01 Backup. Manufacturing of Marlin-01 backup, is initiated. Machining of structural parts and curing of airframe skin are completed. Assembly of airframe and development of avionics and control system assembly is under progress.\r\n\r\nc.   UAV Launcher. Design and manufacturing of MARLIN-01 Launcher / pneumatic circuit testing bench are complete. Improvements for speed enhancement are under progress.\r\n\r\nd.   Jet Engine Testing. Manufacturing and assembly of test bench for P-1000 and P-220 turbo jet engine is completed. P220 Turbo jet engine (for MARLIN-01) is successfully tested for thrust and operating temperatures over varying throttle settings. Intake duct is modified based on the test results. The manufacturing of improved intake duct is under progress.\r\n\r\ne.   UAV Launcher Testing.   Initial testing of launcher with integrated control system and pneumatic circuit at low and medium pressure are successfully completed. Field testing for dead weight and dummy UAV launcher are also planned at PN GHARO facility. Co-ordination for relevant permission is under progress.\r\n \r\nf.   Design of MARLIN-02 (full scaled HSTD). The design is being revised based on the learnings from design / manufacturing activities of MARLIN-01. Detailed design of airframe and integration with launch / recovery systems are also completed. Modifications pertaining to propulsion system and recovery mechanism enhancement are under progress. \r\n\r\ng.   MARLIN-02 launcher. Design of MARLIN-02 launcher is being redesigned based on the learning from design / development of MARLIN-01 Launcher. In this regard, imperative consideration is being given to weight reduction, ease of assembly and transportation. Manufacturing of customized high pneumatic actuator through local industry is also completed. Market surveys for COTs items, pneumatic / control system components and manufacturing progress planning activates are also initialed for subsequent manufacturing.\r\n\r\nh.   Material Testing. Destructive Testing (DT) of composite material samples is being carried out using PNEC and PCSIR equipment. Tensile tests and first phase of bending tests are completed. Manufacturing process is improved in lines with the test results. Bending tests of improved samples are under progress. Also, testing of different composite coring materials is planned and sample are being prepared. Shear Testing Jig in accordance with ASTM D7078 is also design and manufactured for the pertinent testing.\r\n\r\nj.   Wind Tunnel Testing. Computer Aided Design (CAD) model, for development of testing model, has been shared as per the requirements of DESTO.  Estimated of quotation & timeline of 190 working days is received from DESTO. DESTO has been requested to reduce the timeline. Foreign WTT facilitates are also being explored for the pertinent testing.\r\n\r\n2.   Hardware Procurement Status.\r\n\r\na.   Order is placed for procurement of JetCat P-1000 (Germany based 1100N) turbo jet engine. The procurement is under progress; EDD Sep 21.\r\n\r\nb.   Veronte flight controller from M/s Embention has been procured. \r\n\r\nc.   Material for finishing of MARLIN-01 UAV and Launcher are being purchased/ procured as per the requirement of manufacturing under progress.\r\n\r\nd.   Orders are placed for raw material & COTs items for MARLIN-02 UAV and Launcher. The procurement is under progress.\r\n\r\n\r\n?	DSensors	Finalized	2021-09-24 11:33:02	25	Aug 21	-20-25-	\N	f	\N
