250006	624	2021-12-31 12:37:40	1.   PI reply on technical comments of M/s Horizon Tech has been forwarded to concerned Dte. PI letter PN/DG NRDI/R AND D Wing/03/7343114 dated 19 Nov 2019 refers. VA-SNIDS pilot integration at PNS JAUHAR will be initiated upon approval of modalities proposed in said PI letter.\r\n\r\n2.    01 X WEM has been released on 05 May 2021 upon receiving of NI security clearance.\r\n\r\n3. Coordination meeting among all stakeholders of VA-SNIDs integration project was tentatively scheduled in last week of June 2021 at NHQ. D Sec (Ops) letter PN/Security Ops Dte/03/2995695 dated 11 June 2021 refers. However, the same could not be conducted. Fresh date is being coordinated.\r\n\r\n4.   DSO informed about implementation of VA- SNIDs case under process at NSEPC and solution at Field units. Also DSO highlighted that R&D Dte may process the case to meet approval and related requirements as project implemented. D Security letter PN/Security Ops Dte/03/2995695 dated 11 June 2021 refers.\r\n\r\n5.    RDW requested DSO to process and issue necessary instructions as requested and arrange meeting with stakeholders being sponsoring Dte vide letter PN/ DG NRDI/R AND D Wing/03/9516278 dated 18 June 2021. However, DSO replied with no change in stance as highlighted vide para 3 above. PN/Security Ops Dte/03/3011709 dated 22 June 2021 refers.\r\n\r\n6.   A case file w.r.t permission from NI for sharing VA-SNIDs data was processed at NHQ vide PN/DG NRDI/R AND D Wing/02/2955478 dated: 13 Aug 2021.\r\n\r\n7.    Apropos MD IAC directions in light of remarks on above mentioned casefile, an IHD was held between MD IAC along-with core developers of SNIDs Phase -II and Director ET Div with VA technical team on 31 Aug 21 at RDW NRDI. Discussion w.r.t feasibility of system level integration of VA with SNID phase-II, technical constraints in achieving the same and modalities involved was held therein. Subsequent to discussion, the recommended option along-with modified URD has been forwarded to DSO for approval. Letter PN/DG NRDI/R AND D Wing/03/10499051 dated 20 Sep 2021 refers in this regard.	DEnab	Finalized	2022-01-04 14:44:28	25	Dec 21	-20-25-	\N	f	\N
