350012	660	2022-03-03 15:08:31	\r\n1.   Coordination meeting with PN FMG for NDT data acquisition. A meeting was held at NRDI INTELL on 13 Dec 21 vide reference PN/DG NRDI/At PNS JAUHAR/03/11802413 dated 17 Dec 21. The NDT data acquisition methodology for the project was finalized in the meeting. The NDT data comprising of thermal and ultrasonic data will be periodically acquired by FMG team depending upon the availability of Ship/vessel. Point recommended to be dropped.\r\n\r\n2.   Acquisition of Environmental data. The NRDI team acquires the environmental data from PN Ship/vessel on monthly basis. The data was retrieved from the deployed data loggers. Moreover, the team also replaced the battery packs of the data loggers during their visit. The data will be acquired by NRDI team upon availability of the PN Ship/vessel vide reference PN/NCMA/03/12124832 dated 18 Jan 2022. \r\n\r\n3.   Historical Database Development. A historical database is being developed to record the acquired environmental and NDT data from PN ships/vessels. The database is being analyzed at NRDI. Subsequently, data analytics is being performed on the database for estimation of degradation parameter. Data provided by FMG was not suitable; the same has been communicated to the PoC for rectification, vide letter PN/NRDI/R AND D WING/03/12119861 dated 18 Jan 2022. The availability of PN platforms to perform data acquisition activity by NRDI team in the presence of FMG reps is requested vide reference PN/NRDI/ R AND D WING/03/12449213 dated 21 Feb 22.\r\n\r\n4.   Implementation of RUL Prediction Algorithms on Historical Database. A detailed report on “Implementation of RUL Prediction Algorithms on historical database” has been submitted on 10 Jan 22 according to milestone 5 of the project. A presentation on the same was requested vide reference PN/NCMA/03/12240914 dated 01 Feb 22. Subsequently, a detailed presentation was given in a meeting between NRDI NDT & Reliability Engineering Center, NCMA an