the structure. Finally, serial production plan, manufacturing drawing of mold / patterns and Quality Assurance (QA) methods are specified.\r\n\r\nd.   Computational Modeling of SARDOM Radome on-board PNS S/Ms. INTELL was approached to undertake computational study on the S/M SATCOM Radome and suggest design improvements to prevent structural failure and improve fatigue life. A broken sample of S/M Radome and OEM drawings have been received. Method of Finite Element Analysis (FEA) is implemented for stress analysis to determine the stress concentration and fatigue life of structure. Electro-Magnetic (EM) analysis is also performed to determine attenuation characteristics of the structure. Design modification is being done to reduce stress concentration and increase fatigue life of the structure with minimal changes in the EM attenuation characteristics. Finally, manufacturing drawings have been given and manufacturing process is specified. NHQ vide letter  PN/SMM Dte/03/2728197 promulgated that the Radomes be manufactured in lines with newer design proposed by INTELL and submarine Radomes be replaced progressively.	DSensors	Finalized	2021-02-17 09:25:12	25	Jan 21	-20-25-	\N	f	\N
