 house Project Eagle Hunt equipment. \r\nDesign of field deployable ruggedized container to house Reactive Jamming and GPS Spoofing equipment is finalized. The ruggedized container with EM shielding has arrived Karachi Port. The custom clearance by EHQ (N) is in progress.	DSensors	Finalized	2020-04-03 00:00:00	30	Mar 20	-20-35-30-	\N	f	\N
