al version of sub-systems has been established to test the integration of servo motors (of wings, tails, payloads and engine throttle control) with auto-pilot via radio link.\r\n\r\n  c.   Surface finishing of various parts such as bottom-tail, upper v-tail and both wings have been undertaken.\r\n\r\n  d.   The controller for manual pilot input (i.e. HOTAS) has also been ordered.\r\n\r\n5.   Marinized Container to house Project Eagle Hunt equipment.: Equipment for Reactive Jamming and GPS Spoofing will be integrated on container upon the availability of container.	DSensors	Finalized	2020-05-20 12:07:58	30	Apr 20	-20-25-30-	\N	f	\N
