350005	264	2020-11-11 10:32:10	1.   Design Activities.\r\n\r\n      a.   Engine mounts and intake ducts have been designed for JetCat P-1000 turbo jet engine and integrated into the airframe alongwith Servos and control mechanism.\r\n\r\n      b.   Detailed critical design of wing, empennage, control surface, fuselage & fuel tank is undertaken and first iteration of critical design phase is completed.\r\n\r\n      c.   UAV Launcher. CAD modelling of pneumatic circuit components and rail structure has been undertaken. Local industry has been engaged for the manufacturing of the pneumatic actuator as per INTELL design.\r\n\r\n      d.   A Scaled Down Model (SDM) of the HSTD is being designed. The SDM will serve as platform for testing of various design concepts and manufacturing techniques.\r\n\r\n2.   Hardware Procurement Status.\r\n\r\n      a.   Procurement of JetCat P-1000 (Germany based 1100N) turbo jet engine is under process. \r\n\r\n      b.   Veronte Flight controller of M/s Embention has been finalized. Procurement case has been raised for approval.\r\n\r\n      c.   Material for manufacturing of airframe will be finalized based on destructive testing (DT) & Non Destructive Testing (NDT) of material samples.\r\n\r\n3.   Way Forward. Test results of sample materials for airframe components will lead towards the 2nd iteration of critical design activities and design review / revision prior to design finalization activities.	DR&D	Finalized	2020-11-11 10:32:33	25	Oct 20	-20-25-	-20-25-	f	\N
