350010	677	2022-04-27 02:32:34	\r\n1.   Harbor Acceptance Trials. Harbor Acceptance Trials of all 19 VFDs is being carried out. Request for INTELL NRDI team during Harbor Acceptance Trials is made by PN DY. Point recommended to be dropped.\r\n \r\n2.   Factory Acceptance Trials. Factory Acceptance Trials of 02 Air Conditioner VFDs, 02 Fresh Water VFDs and 02 Sea Water VFDs were carried out in the presence of PNDY representatives on 20th December 2021 at NRDI and after complete functionality testing all the 06 VFDs were handed over to PNDY representatives. This concluded the FATs of all 19 VFDs to be developed under this work order. Point recommended to be dropped.\r\n\r\n3.   Workshop Acceptance Trials. Workshop Acceptance Trials of the 06 VFDs were carried out on 21st December 2021 at PNDY workshop. The safety checks for all 06 VFDs were carried out successfully in the presence of ship staff, PNDY and NRDI representatives. This concluded the Workshop Acceptance Trials of all 19 VFDs to be developed under this work order. Point recommended to be dropped.  \r\n\r\n4.   VFDs Handing Over. As of 21 Dec 21, 19 VFDs for 09 different applications were handed over to PNDY with satisfactory Factory & Workshop Acceptance Trials.  Point recommended to be dropped.\r\n\r\n5.   Appreciation Letter. Timely delivery of 150T VFD for DA pump after successful modification of PN S/M KHALID is highly appreciated by PND vide letter PN/PN DOCKYARD/ S/M WING/GM (ME S/M WING)/03/10930706 dated 21 Oct 21. Point recommended to be dropped.\r\n\r\n6.   Provision of Three Speeds on DA-Pump VFD. Activity to enable third speed on DA pump VFD has been carried out by NRDI INTELL team. Team visited dockyard and carried out replacement activity of the installed VFD on board S/M. Testing of the same has been carried out by DY team as well and performance was found to be in-line with requested URD. Point recommended to be dropped.\r\n\r\n7.   Correspondence. Following correspondence has been carried out. Point recommended to be dropped.\r\n\r\na.   Queries regarding electrical panel design along with the preliminary panel for Hydraulic pump have been forwarded to DY team. Once approved and accepted by DY team, the electrical panel will be implemented by NRDI INTELL.\r\n\r\nb.   FATs for HPAC VFDs are successfully completed. HPAC VFDs will be handed over to PND on 7 Dec 21 for workshop trials.\r\n\r\n8.   Documentation Finalization. INTELL NRDI team has developed documents including technical and operating manuals, based on provided feedback from DY team. Documentation draft was sent to PN dockyard for approval and generally considered accepted. However, minor suggestions from PND are received, vide reference PN/PN DOCKYARD/S/M WING/GM (ME S/M WING) / 03/12388607 dated 18 Feb 22. The same are being rectified by INTELL team.\r\n\r\n9.   Troubleshooting Support to PND. Following support and troubleshooting activities were carried out during Feb 22:\r\n\r\na.   PN Dockyard raised the RPM issue regarding DM and DY application which was resolved by NRDI INTELL on 8th Feb 2022 vide reference PN/PN DOCKYARD/S/M WING/GM (ME S/M WING) / 03/12198542 dated 01 Feb 22. On-site support was provided to resolve the reported issue.\r\n\r\nb.   PN Dockyard raised the issue for blank keypad display which was resolved by NRDI INTELL on 16th Feb 2022.\r\n\r\nc.   Cooling pump (DK1) issue on local mode was raised by PN dockyard. The issue was resolved by NRDI INTELL team through remote support.\r\n\r\n\r\n10.   Sea Acceptance Trials. The Sea Acceptance Trials (SAT) of NRDI developed VFDs installed onboard PNS KHALID are currently in progress.	DSensors	Cancelled	2022-04-27 02:32:55	19	Apr 22	-19-	\N	f	\N
