350023	1149	2024-01-15 16:18:15.519	Progress\r\n\r\n1.   Filter Design. Cavity based filters for L1 (1.3-1.5 GHz), L2 (1.7-1.8 GHz), and S-band (2.2-2.5 GHz) have been designed and fabricated. Design is further consolidated through reverse engineering of the original OEM filter using XRF analyzer for material characterization and 3D Scanner for dimensional analysis.\r\n\r\n2.   Field Testing. 09 x filters have been assembled and are ready to deliver, same has been informed to sponsoring directorate vide reference PN/R AND D WING/PROJECTS/5436562 dated 25 Sep 23. Moreover, draft ATPs have been revised vide letter PN/HQ COMPAK/MAINTENANCE/5714329 dated 13 Oct 23. Furthermore, NHQ was informed vide letter PN/R AND D WING/GENERAL/6485602 Dated 07 Dec 23 that filters are ready for delivery and conduct of ATPs.\r\n\r\n3.   Conduct of FATs. FATs of NRDI INTELL fabricated 09 x filters were successfully conducted on 20 Dec 23 in the presence of 47 Sqn reps at NRDI INTELL. VNA testing along with material characterization was also performed during FATs. All filters were checked and performance was found within acceptable ranges. Afterwards, filters were handed over to 47 sqn reps for conduct of field trials, vide letter PN/R AND D WING/GENERAL/6669049 Dated 21 Dec 23.	DSensors	Finalized	2024-02-01 12:43:52.725	25	Dec 23	-19-25-	\N	f	\N
