350025	1175	2024-02-06 16:35:04.819	Progress\r\n\r\n1.   PDR Submission. The "Preliminary Design Report" (PDR) has been submitted against Milestone M5. \r\n\r\n2.   Procurement. Sintering furnace is being procured which will be utilized for development of cathode.\r\n\r\n3.   Design Activities. Reverse engineering for dimensional analysis and material characterization using XRF analyzer held with NRDI is in progress. Moreover, heater design, Electron Gun and slow wave structure designing is in progress. Power supply of existing TWT of LR66 radar is received at NRDI INTELL which will be utilized in this project. \r\n\r\n       a.   Design of Waveguide to Coaxial Adapter for cold testing of existing TWT on VNA.\r\n\r\n       b.   Heater Design: Sample heater coil has been successfully designed and manufactured. The manufacturing process has been established. The final design of heater coil will be developed based on calculation of cathode temperature and work function. \r\n\r\n       c.   Pierce Electron Gun: Simulation of Pierce electron Gun is also been revised after finalization of SWS.\r\n\r\n       d.   Slow Wave Structure: Design has been completed. \r\n\r\n       e.   Collector Design:  Collector is being redesigned in accordance with beam spent curve analysis of slow wave structure. \r\n\r\n4.   Development of ARRC. Advance radar research center (ARRC) is being developed at manufacturing facility PNS KARSAZ. Design of ARRC has been completed whereas, development of Clean room is in progress. Procurement of Molecular Vacuum Pump & Bio Safety Cabinet are in progress.	DSensors	Under Finalization	\N	25	Jan 24	-19-25-	\N	f	\N
350028	1178	2024-02-06 16:40:07.871	Progress\r\n\r\n1.   Project Plan Submission. The "Global Project Plan" (GPP) has been submitted against Milestone M2. The same has been forwarded to MTSS for invoice and onward submission.\r\n\r\n2.   HPO Submission. The "Hardware Purchase Order" (HPO) has been submitted against Milestone M3. The same has been forwarded to MTSS for invoice and onward submission.\r\n\r\n3.   Detailed Design Report. Milestone M4 (Submission of Detailed Design Report) has been submitted.\r\n\r\n4.   Sourcing of Heat Sink. Required 5 kW Heat Sink was received and tested with 02 kW magnetron. Same heat sink will be utilized as load for effective power combination of 4 x S band 1KW magnetrons.\r\n\r\n5.   Study for Next Phase. Study for development of high power electromagnetic sources for enhance lethality and extended ranges is in progress.\r\n\r\n6.   Design Activities. \r\n\r\n       a.   Design of antenna mode converter for enhanced gain from TE10 to TE11 is completed along with conical antenna. Fabrication of mode converter and antenna is in process. \r\n\r\n       b.   Study and design mechanism of circularly polarized conical horn antenna is in progress.\r\n\r\n7.   Lab Testing. Lab testing with 04 x Magnetrons is completed.	DSensors	Under Finalization	\N	25	Jan 24	-19-25-	\N	f	\N
