250005	1286	2024-08-09 12:44:06.969	1.   The case file for PN wide implementation of VA project and its related modalities was processed at NHQ and approved by the competent authority amounting Rs 78M. Case file PN/ Security OPS Dte/02/2954141 dated 31 March 2020 refers.\r\n\r\n2.   Subsequently following steps were taken:\r\n\r\n       a.   The initial survey of 13 x PN units (Priority I & II) w.r.t C&CC location, available network, SNIDs Phase – II working, hardware requirements etc was conducted in June and July 2021.  A comprehensive report of the survey was forwarded to Dir Security (Ops). PI letter PN/DG NRDI/R AND D Wing/03/10049564 dated 16 Aug 2021 refers.\r\n\r\n       b.   A case file w.r.t permission from NI for sharing VA-SNIDs data was processed at NHQ vide PN/DG NRDI/R AND D Wing/02/2955478 dated: 13 Aug 2021.\r\n\r\n       c.   An IHD was held between MD IAC along-with core developers of SNIDs Phase -II and Director ET Div with VA technical team on 31 Aug 21 at RDW NRDI to discuss modalities involved in VA SNIDs integration process.\r\n\r\n3.   The project was presented in 3rd R & Board meeting. As per decision of the Board Meeting, MD IAC has been nominated to take up the project as Sponsoring Dte. Accordingly, MD IAC has to evaluate proposed project, formulate URD and process Project Proposal Form, if required.	DEnab	Finalized	2024-08-29 10:43:04.836	25	Jul 24	-19-25-	\N	f	\N
