350024	1272	2024-07-08 15:15:00.372	Progress\r\n\r\n1.   Submission of Project Plan and List of Deliverables. The "Project Plan and List of Deliverables" has been submitted against Milestone M2. The same has been forwarded to MTSS for invoice and onward submission.\r\n\r\n2.   Submission of Design Report & Drawings. Design of Radome assembly has been completed. Structural analysis for verification of design is also completed. A report encompassing the design details is submitted, against Milestone M4. The same has been forwarded to MTSS for invoice and onward submission. \r\n\r\n3.   Manufacturing of Radome and Base. Manufacturing of these parts in line with already developed detailed drawings has been completed. The developed parts have been sent to PND for acceptance testing, against Milestone M6. Through pressure testing, the structural integrity of Radome has been qualified. The initial design of Radome also successfully resisted water ingress up-to 44 bar pressure. However, water ingress is observed at 45 bar pressure. Design upgradations have been made in the material of Radome base, its thread size, location and size of seal groove. After design updates, the Radome has successfully passed ingress protection at 45 bar pressure.\r\n\r\n4.   Handover and Testing. The pressure (45 bar for 1 hour) and RF testing is successfully conducted. The developed Radome has been handed over to PND for acceptance.\r\n\r\n5.   Alternative flange design. A design modification of flange is being carried out to improve sealing performance and ease of installation. In this approach the flange will be tightened by means of bolts of known strength and tightening torques.	DSensors	Finalized	2024-08-01 14:58:09.113	25	Jun 24	-19-25-	\N	f	\N
