1	86	R&D/Projects/Proc/86	26 August 2026	REQUEST FOR QUOTATION	1.\tR&D Wing NRDI at PNS JAUHAR is interested for the procurement of ROTAX Engine. In this regard, quotation are to be submitted to MD R&D at NRDI by 09 September 2026.	2.\tQuotation will be opened on same day at 11:00 hrs in the presence of all participants or their representatives and will be accepted at lowest quotations rate basis. However, It is apprised that MD (R&D) reserves the right to reject/ accept any quotation or invite new quotation without assigning any reason.	3.\tFollowing terms and condition would apply:\n\n\ta.\tItems are to be delivered within 15 days after issuance of purchase order.\n\tb.\tPayment will be processed / made after delivery and acceptance by user.\n\tc.\tPart Delivery / Partial shall not be entertained.\n\td.\tWarrantee / Guarantee of one year is required.	MUHAMMAD MUDASSIR	Cdr (R) Pakistan Navy	R&D Wing, NRDI	[]	[]	2026-08-26 06:34:13	2026-08-26 06:34:13	See distribution	["1.\\tR&D Wing NRDI at PNS JAUHAR is interested for the procurement of ROTAX Engine. In this regard, quotation are to be submitted to MD R&D at NRDI by 09 September 2026.", "2.\\tQuotation will be opened on same day at 11:00 hrs in the presence of all participants or their representatives and will be accepted at lowest quotations rate basis. However, It is apprised that MD (R&D) reserves the right to reject/ accept any quotation or invite new quotation without assigning any reason.", "3.\\tFollowing terms and condition would apply:\\n\\n\\ta.\\tItems are to be delivered within 15 days after issuance of purchase order.\\n\\tb.\\tPayment will be processed / made after delivery and acceptance by user.\\n\\tc.\\tPart Delivery / Partial shall not be entertained.\\n\\td.\\tWarrantee / Guarantee of one year is required."]
